    "TextContent": {
      "description": "The content of a Text node.\n\n``font_file`` is the path to the font file, so every engine draws the\nsame face, at ``font_weight``. ``font_family`` is the family name for\nengines that need one. Colours are project data, never defaults.\n\n``text`` is already broken into lines (``\\n``) by the lowering; the\nnode's ``bounds`` is its CSS box and each line is aligned inside its\nwidth per ``text_align``. ``line_height`` is in ems; ``None`` is CSS\n``normal``. ``text_transform`` and ``letter_spacing`` (pixels) are\nCSS's. ``text_shadow`` is a CSS ``text-shadow`` list - an outline is\nexpressed the way the compositions express it, as zero-blur offset\nshadows.\n\n``runs`` carries the node's inline runs when the text is styled run by\nrun (StagedScene's model): each run its own size, weight, colour,\nletter-spacing and reveal, sharing baselines. ``layout`` is ``\"native\"``\n(the engine lays the text out with CSS's rules) or ``\"browser\"`` (a\nbrowser measured the boxes and the engine draws at those positions).",
      "properties": {
        "text": {
          "title": "Text",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "font_family": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Font Family"
